; PONG for the custom CPU emulator; assumes a 64x48 pixel screen
; Controls: W/S move the left paddle; UP/DOWN move the right paddle.
; Vertical bounce now occurs before moving: y=1 reverses upward motion, y=46 reverses downward motion.
; Uses three-cell instructions and absolute ROM-cell jump addresses.
; Screen dimensions were not supplied separately; these limits match the provided 64x48 examples.

